#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0492 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "DISCRIMINATING. SHIFT100 DOES match ^SHIFT(\\d+)\$ - y compiles to the unbounded group (\\d+) - but PMDA-AD0492 declares _wildcards: {y: {min: 1, max: 99}}, which WildcardExpander.satisfiesFilters applies as a FILTER on the OBSERVED capture. Capture 100 is dropped, the anchor set is empty after filtering, and the result is NoMatch -> SKIPPED. If this fires, the filter is not being applied - escalate, do not change the index."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PARAMCD  type=Char
col SHIFT100 type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | NORMAL to HIGH
